{
  "name": "HP EliteBook 840 G5 / G6 - Hungarian (ISO)",
  "match": [
    "EliteBook 840 G5",
    "EliteBook 840 G6"
  ],
  "layout": "hu",
  "timeout": 5,
  "notes": [
    "Layout from photo + real test run on 840 G6 (BIOS action-keys mode ON).",
    "F-keys list both codes: plain F-code and the action code.",
    "silent_in_action_mode: key sends nothing without Fn in action-keys mode -> prompted as 'Fn + Fx'.",
    "combo: modifier set the key sends on its own (calendar/screen keys send Ctrl+Alt + an unmapped scancode).",
    "accept_scan: any unmapped scancode (SCAN_xx) not used by another key also passes.",
    "840 G6 run 2026-11-04 (action mode OFF): Screen key = Ctrl+Alt+SCAN_6d, Fn+F11 = SCAN_f8, F12 = KEY_F12."
  ],
